# Supabase (Tavrion)

Project ref: `jilehijfjayayfumbrsl`

## Credentials

Load from the repo root `.env` (gitignored). Never commit or paste secrets into tracked files.

| Variable | Use |
|----------|-----|
| `SUPABASE_URL` | Direct API URL for server/scripts |
| `VITE_SUPABASE_URL` | Browser proxy path (`/api/sb`) |
| `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` / `VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` | Public anon key (RLS enforced) |
| `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` | Server-only; bypasses RLS |
| `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN` | Dashboard access token for migrations / CLI (Management API) |
| `SUPABASE_PROJECT_REF` | CLI / Management API project id |

## Agent workflow

- For Node scripts: `import dotenv from 'dotenv'; dotenv.config();` then read env vars.
- For migrations: run `node scripts/apply-uploaded-course-enum.mjs` or `node scripts/run-migrations.mjs` — both read `SUPABASE_ACCESS_TOKEN` from `.env` via dotenv.
- For data checks: use `@supabase/supabase-js` with `SUPABASE_URL` + `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`.
- Never put `service_role` in frontend code or commit it to git.
